Extract the Archive and copy the File *C-NET-FE* to a Drawer where you want it
to be. I would copy it into the PFILES Drawer. Then just run it as a Multi-
Access-C-Net-C-P-File (what a Word - and so many "-"'s) anywhere in your BBS.
Probably before the User enters his/her Handle !! Do it like thiz:

            #2Pfiles:C-Net-FE}
            |
            `-> Guess what - It's a CTRL + Q !!

That's all !! Now reload your BBSTexts/Menus and you'll have a nice FrontEnd.

I Hope you have lotsa Fun with this Program and that you really like it.

